  - m_Id: 797066481664
    m_Localized: The leaves of these and other holly species are used in the manufacture
      of medicines. The berries are highly poisonous and should not be ingested.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 455473975296
    m_Localized: Does not tolerate frost very well. Hardy. Flowers during summer
      and early autumn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 887952855040
    m_Localized: Drought-resistant succulent plant. It creates dense shade around
      it, reducing soil evaporation and protecting sun-sensitive species.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969402044416
    m_Localized: Fast-growing vertical plant. Its ample shade and ability to retain
      moisture make it a key element in balancing arid areas of the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1028441067520
    m_Localized: A shrub with large, glossy leaves that creates a cool microclimate
      beneath its canopy. It serves as a refuge for insects and small birds, stabilising
      the humidity of the environment and improving the overall health of the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1078470725632
    m_Localized: A small, fruit-bearing plant that grows in humid areas. It produces
      sweet fruits that attract wildlife and provide a moderate income.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1140810665984
    m_Localized: A tree-like cactus that provides light shade and blooms with small
      flowers. Its edible fruit adds ecological and economic value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1205713326080
    m_Localized: Drought-resistant aromatic plant. Improves soil health and attracts
      bees even in dry climates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1258402172928
    m_Localized: An elegant plant with balanced growth. Its white flowers enhance
      the biodiversity of the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1283085651968
    m_Localized: A simple, common plant that grows quickly. Perfect for beginners
      and for stabilising dry soils.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1368427155456
    m_Localized: A classic flower, medium growth and susceptible to pests. Its presence
      increases overall pollination in the garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1433468227584
    m_Localized: Edible fruit plant. Requires constant watering and rich soil. When
      ripe, it produces tomatoes that can be sold or used as a food source.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1503966089216
    m_Localized: Low-maintenance staple cereal. Provides food, seeds and shelter
      for small animals and insects. Promotes wildlife and soil stability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1584752578560
    m_Localized: Shrub with tubular flowers and clusters of intense red colour. A
      very attractive and compact plant, prized in gardening for its long flowering
      period and its ability to attract hummingbirds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1647948156928
    m_Localized: Seasonal plant with intense, short flowering period. Ideal for marking
      the natural cycle of the garden and providing temporary colour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1710309068800
    m_Localized: An exotic plant that blooms slowly. It requires constant moisture
      and rich soil.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 498272550342656
    m_Localized: Attract pollinators to the four adjacent plots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 498335653646336
    m_Localized: 'If it is healthy and pollinated, it will produce fruit. Every time
      you harvest its fruit, you will earn '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 498539937222656
    m_Localized: It provides partial shade to the four adjacent plots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 498693637492736
    m_Localized: It attracts wildlife that protects the four adjacent plots from
      pests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 498762164031488
    m_Localized: ' petals.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
